Package: gettoken-secret-manager
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}@DEPENDS@:gettoken-secret-manager
Description: token broker for AI agents - super-token store
 The store holds the super-tokens a human placed on the privileged side,
 keyed by who holds them and which service they are for, and keeps every
 version that was put in.
 .
 The store is /var/lib/gettoken/secrets, and no account but the privileged one
 can read it. Nothing an agent runs reaches it; only the exchanger does, to
 hand a plugin the super-token it trades for a narrow one. Purging this package
 takes the store with it.
